    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97184" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρεφεδῑνέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spin, whirl round</i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>spin round and round</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρεφεδίνηθεν δέ οἱ ὄσσε</span>, of one stunned by a
			blow, <i><span class="en">
