				16.792
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr. in 
				Act.
			, <i>spin, whirl round</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				13.7
			</span></i>. Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στροφοδινέομαι</span>.</div>
